<title>LATVIA: ZEMES BANKA FIRST-HALF PROFIT 685,000 LATS.</title>
<headline>ZEMES BANKA FIRST-HALF PROFIT 685,000 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zemes Banka on Monday said it made a profit in the first half of the year of 685,000 lats on assets of 48.60 million lats.</p>
<p>The bank in a statement gave no comparative figures. It said it had made loans worth 19.55 million lats and had deposits of 25.57 million lats, of which 5.13 million lats were by individuals.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
